2026-07-27T14:07:04.0868907Z i /tmp/RtmptBVZZV/duckdb
2026-07-27T14:07:04.0869430Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T14:07:04.0870164Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:07:04.0871235Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:07:04.0872240Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:07:04.0873705Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:07:04.0874642Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
